168
00:11:47,640 --> 00:11:49,450
Please spare my life.

169
00:11:49,320 --> 00:11:50,610
Please spare my life.

170
00:11:52,600 --> 00:11:54,290
I must act fast,

171
00:11:54,040 --> 00:11:55,290
I must act fast !

172
