243
00:16:26,680 --> 00:16:28,650
Teng Huayuan...

244
00:16:29,400 --> 00:16:32,530
Since you like those 9 Nascent Soul so much,

245
00:16:32,980 --> 00:16:34,570
I will kill them

246
00:16:35,280 --> 00:16:37,330
