247
00:16:37,560 --> 00:16:39,010
I will destroy them

248
00:16:39,120 --> 00:16:41,450
one by one.

249
00:16:45,080 --> 00:16:47,930
I want you to see your Teng Family

250
00:16:48,670 --> 00:16:51,050
